WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.176 --> 00:00:15.197
felt a blast of heat.

2
00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:20.741
An orange bubbling liquid covered the floor.

3
00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:23.402
"Lava, hot!"

4
00:00:23.703 --> 00:00:24.323
Bippo said.

5
00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:31.208
A walkway extended over the lava, connecting to a large platform.

6
00:00:32.436 --> 00:00:34.438
A gigantic robot stood on the platform.

7
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.420
Wukong gulped.

8
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.343
"That's the biggest demon I've ever seen!"

9
00:00:41.844 --> 00:00:43.365
Cozlin's eyes were wide.

10
00:00:43.385 --> 00:00:49.531
"Meltron!" Roxy flew up, floating in front of the giant robot's face.

11
00:00:49.551 --> 00:00:53.434
"We're here to destroy you, Meltron!"

12
00:00:53.454 --> 00:00:58.758
"Someone else tried to destroy me once," Meltron said.

13
00:00:58.778 --> 00:01:00.240
"It didn't work."

14
00:01:01.288 --> 00:01:02.449
Roxy raised an eyebrow.

15
00:01:02.469 --> 00:01:07.753
"Huh?" "My creator threw me away," Meltron said.

16
00:01:07.773 --> 00:01:10.516
"I was much different back then.

17
00:01:11.717 --> 00:01:13.478
I was getting old and a bit rusty.

18
00:01:14.939 --> 00:01:19.643
My creator built a new robot and tossed me into a pile of scrap metal.

19
00:01:20.904 --> 00:01:24.247
I might have been a simple farming robot, but I was smart.

20
00:01:25.488 --> 00:01:26.449
I fixed myself.

21
00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:30.292
Over the years I've made myself bigger and stronger.

22
00:01:31.508 --> 00:01:36.072
And I've made sure that nobody will ever throw me away again!"

23
00:01:39.795 --> 00:01:42.177
"Your robots are destroying planets!"

24
00:01:42.618 --> 00:01:43.358
Cozlin said.

25
00:01:43.378 --> 00:01:45.840
"Bad, you!"

26
00:01:46.161 --> 00:01:46.801
Bippo said.

27
00:01:46.821 --> 00:01:49.764
"The planets are fine," Meltron said.

28
00:01:49.784 --> 00:01:54.488
"But I assume you're upset because living things can't survive on them anymore.

29
00:01:55.569 --> 00:01:59.072
Living things get rid of robots and other machines all the time.

30
00:02:01.288 --> 00:02:04.231
Now it's time for robots to get rid of living things!"

31
00:02:06.032 --> 00:02:08.295
Suddenly dozens of robots flew into the room.

32
00:02:09.856 --> 00:02:11.578
They shot toward Roxy and her friends.

33
00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.501
Wukong swung his iron bar.

34
00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:18.584
One robot shattered and fell into the lava.

35
00:02:19.825 --> 00:02:21.006
More robots attacked him.

36
00:02:23.528 --> 00:02:27.232
Wukong flipped through the air, twirling his iron bar in every direction.

37
00:02:28.628 --> 00:02:31.850
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blew up a robot.

38
00:02:33.772 --> 00:02:37.334
A piece of it hit a second robot, and they both splashed into the lava.

39
00:02:38.895 --> 00:02:40.116
Cozlin leaped into the air.

40
00:02:41.417 --> 00:02:43.719
Roxy watched as Cozlin seemed to disappear.

41
00:02:44.999 --> 00:02:47.561
All Roxy saw was a blur zipping back and forth.

42
00:02:48.922 --> 00:02:51.324
Everywhere this blur went, robots exploded.

43
00:02:51.344 --> 00:02:54.086
"Wow!" Roxy thought.

44
00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:56.828
"Cozlin is really fast!"

45
00:02:58.568 --> 00:02:59.729
A robot grabbed her arm.

46
00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:01.670
Bippo fired lasers.

47
00:03:02.191 --> 00:03:04.833
Pew! The robot exploded.

48
00:03:05.413 --> 00:03:08.735
Boom! "Nice work, Bippo!"

49
00:03:09.075 --> 00:03:09.716
Roxy said.

50
00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:13.459
But then she groaned as more robots flew into the room.

51
00:03:13.479 --> 00:03:16.321
"There are too many of them!"

52
00:03:16.641 --> 00:03:19.303
she thought.

53
00:03:19.983 --> 00:03:20.924
Meltron laughed.

54
00:03:20.944 --> 00:03:23.205
"You'll never stop me!"

55
00:03:23.225 --> 00:03:26.748
"We'll see about that!"

56
00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.421
Wukong leaped toward Meltron's head.

57
00:03:30.281 --> 00:03:32.182
He muttered a spell and became tiny.

58
00:03:34.063 --> 00:03:36.984
Then he squeezed through a small hole in the side of the robot's head.

59
00:03:38.505 --> 00:03:39.585
Wukong looked around.

60
00:03:40.465 --> 00:03:43.687
Strange glowing objects hummed and buzzed all around him.

61
00:03:43.707 --> 00:03:46.768
"I have to find that controller!"

62
00:03:46.988 --> 00:03:47.808
Wukong said.

63
00:03:47.828 --> 00:03:51.570
"Your Majesty!"

64
00:03:53.111 --> 00:03:55.972
A government worker ran into King Radnik's office in the bunker.

65
00:03:57.292 --> 00:04:00.273
"We just received a message from our allies in the Quill Region.

66
00:04:00.653 --> 00:04:03.254
Three more planets have been invaded by robots!"

67
00:04:04.854 --> 00:04:06.015
King Radnik bit his lip.

68
00:04:06.035 --> 00:04:08.296
"This is bad!"

69
00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:14.137
On Hulzar, the portal makers hid in their laboratory.

70
00:04:15.498 --> 00:04:17.378
The robots' drills rumbled above them.

71
00:04:17.398 --> 00:04:20.740
"Those robots will reach us soon!"

72
00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:21.740
Flix said.

73
00:04:24.628 --> 00:04:27.229
As Roxy battled Meltron, she heard her watch beep.

74
00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.530
Bloom! What's wrong?"

75
00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:36.132
"We have a big problem, Rocket Girl!"

76
00:04:37.252 --> 00:04:39.032
The mayor walked to the window of his office.

77
00:04:41.193 --> 00:04:42.834
Roxy saw robots in the street.

78
00:04:44.494 --> 00:04:45.454
"Oh no!"

79
00:04:45.855 --> 00:04:46.555
Roxy cried.

80
00:04:46.575 --> 00:04:50.276
"Meltron's robots are invading Earth now!"
